/*!
\page page_strichhit StRichHit

\brief \ref page_strichhit "StRichHit" — reconstructed Cherenkov photon or MIP impact point in the RICH detector.

\section strichhit_overview Overview
StRichHit is the reconstructed hit object for the RICH detector. Each hit
represents either a Cherenkov photon impact on the pad plane or the
minimum-ionising particle (MIP) track impact point. Hits are derived from
\ref page_strichcluster "StRichCluster" objects and carry position information
in three coordinate frames: global (inherited from StHit), local pad-plane,
and internal detector coordinates. The ring of photon hits around the MIP
position is used to measure the Cherenkov angle θ_C for particle identification.

\section strichhit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StMeasuredPoint
        └── StHit
            └── StRichHit
\endcode

\section strichhit_members Data Members
| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| StThreeVectorF | mLocal | Hit position in local pad-plane coordinates (cm) |
| StThreeVectorF | mLError | Position error in local pad-plane coordinates (cm) |
| StThreeVectorF | mInternal | Hit position in internal detector coordinates (cm) |
| StThreeVectorF | mSigma | Position uncertainty in internal detector coordinates (cm) |
| Float_t | mMaxAmplitude | Maximum ADC amplitude in the parent cluster |
| Int_t | mClusterNumber | Index of the parent cluster |
| UInt_t | mTrack | Associated track identifier |
| UInt_t | mReservedLong | Hit-status flag bit field (StRichHitFlag) |
| Float_t | mReservedFloat | Reserved for future use |
| UInt_t | mNumberOfPads | Number of pads contributing to this hit |

\section strichhit_methods Key Methods
| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| StThreeVectorF local() const | Local pad-plane hit position |
| StThreeVectorF internal() const | Internal detector hit position |
| float maxAmplitude() const | Maximum cluster ADC amplitude |
| int clusterNumber() const | Parent cluster index |
| unsigned int track() const | Associated track identifier |
| unsigned int numberOfPads() const | Number of contributing pads |
| bool isSet(StRichHitFlag) const | Test a hit-status flag bit |
| void setBit(StRichHitFlag) | Set a hit-status flag bit |
| void unSetBit(StRichHitFlag) | Clear a hit-status flag bit |
| unsigned int flags() const | Raw flag bit field |
| StDetectorId detector() const | Returns kRichId |

\section strichhit_example Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StRichCollection* rich = event->richCollection();
StSPtrVecRichHit& hits = rich->getRichHits();
for (const auto& hit : hits) {
    StThreeVectorF pos = hit->local();
    float amp = hit->maxAmplitude();
}
\endcode

\section strichhit_related Related Classes
\ref page_strichcluster "StRichCluster" — parent cluster. \n
\ref page_strichmchit "StRichMCHit" — MC truth extension. \n
\ref page_strichpidtraits "StRichPidTraits" — PID traits that reference the MIP hit.
*/
